          "timeout": "One total deadline covers the version probe, voice query, native narration and the fresh verification re-synthesis. Each child CPU 60 s, address space 2 GiB, output size capped at 16 MiB (a runaway guard; the 120 s and 8 MiB budgets are judged on the finished file); standalone verify has a 180 s budget.",
